 no Kanzume Otokuyou.\n\nPutter Golf is essentially (but whether or not it officially is is unknown) a Mega Drive version of Putt & Putter: a very simple golf game with an isometric perspective. Rather than compete on wide open courts however, the game opts for much smaller levels which would only require a putter (much like minigolf). As well as this, there are a number of obstacles which can get in your way, from bumpers to lava.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/putter-golf", "videos": [{"id": 168377, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "qAA8M0IdPnQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qAA8M0IdPnQ", "title": "Genesis - Putter Golf (1990)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qAA8M0IdPnQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}